{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1354891-some-advice-on-a-new-changelng-campaign","id":1354891,"title":"Some advice on a new Changelng campaign...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-14T08:37:56-08:00","id":1354891,"title":"Some advice on a new Changelng campaign...","content":"Hi, folks! So, I'm looking for some advice here...<br /> <br /> Ever since I met my then-girlfriend, now-wife, four years ago, I've been committed to running a Changeling campaign with her, as a one-on-one kind of thing. We held off from starting, because of health issues on my part, and getting married taking up a lot of time, and then Second Edition being announced... and now, finally, we are on the cusp of beginning to get organised enough to start thinking about kicking a campaign off.<br /> <br /> As an additional venture she and I have talked about on various occasions, we'd love to start doing a podcast together. We discussed various different ideas, but one of them which seems to have taken hold and might actually be the route we go down, is an actual play podcast of our campaign.<br /> <br /> Here's where it gets tricky, and where I could do with some advice... I'm torn as to where to set the campaign.<br /> <br /> On the one hand, it would be really interesting to do something set in New Orleans and the surrounding area. I've long had a fascination and passion for the city, and there's a lot of stuff I could pull on surrounding the regeneration since Katrina (of both the mundane and Changeling societies), and looking at how the threat of a second, even greater storm might impact both communities. The difficulty of this is, my wife and I are British - and it would feel wrong to attempt to do cod Creole and Louisiana accents on a recording which might then be heard by people form all over.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, there's my local bailiwick of south Devon and Dartmoor, which is rife with old folklore and faerie connections, as well as being somewhat more feasible for the accent work.<br /> <br /> I could pitch good stories for both settings - hell, most of the ideas I have could be ported from one to the other, with a little bit of tweaking - and I'm genuinely unsure about which setting I would prefer to play in.<br /> <br /> I guess what it comes down to is - if this is going to be recorded, how important is it to have accents that pertain to the area being played in?<br /> <br /> Your thoughts would be greatly appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25847-jonofdevon","name":"JonOfDevon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T09:01:33-08:00","id":1354892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JonOfDevon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1354891-some-advice-on-a-new-changelng-campaign#post1354891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess what it comes down to is - if this is going to be recorded, how important is it to have accents that pertain to the area being played in?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not important at all; I would actually say accents can detract from the experience, especially if they're for all the locals and not an odd man out or two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}